    "source": "お疲れ様でした。\nまたね、●●●●●●●●●●ぴぃちゃん。",
    "before": "辛苦大家了。\n明天见咯，{{GS_ADDRESS:0:producer_name}}P酱。",
    "after": "辛苦大家了。\n回头见咯，{{GS_ADDRESS:0:producer_name}}P酱。",
    "reason": "またね"
  },
  {
    "rid": "T000360",
    "document_id": "1_1_016_04_j",
    "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000",
