    "before": "你的名字……\n是叫{{GS_ADDRESS:0:producer_name_with_p}}先生啊。",
    "after": "你的名字……\n是叫{{GS_ADDRESS:0:producer_name_with_p}}啊。",
    "reason": "Slot＋さん keeps the slot only"
